# The attract demo's recording (tools/make_attract.sh -> romdisk/demo/attract.in; GDD 5: "a recorded input script of the
# first minutes: arrival, talk to Wren, first patrol"). Played from a new game's start (the host harness's game_init).
pace 40
choose 1 0
talk wren
chase slime_a
wait 90
talk brom
wait 60
